{"id":"unertra_glich","lemma":"unerträglich","pos":"adj","rank":4165,"glosses":["unbearable, intolerable"],"ipa":"/ˈʊnɛɐ̯ˌtʁɛːklɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ca/De-unertr%C3%A4glich.ogg/De-unertr%C3%A4glich.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"unerträglicher","superlative":"am unerträglichsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Es war unerträglich heiß.","en":"It was unbearably hot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757934","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"hot"}]},{"text":"Der Schmerz war unerträglich.","en":"The pain was agonizing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758547","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"physical pain, ache"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Die Hitze ist unerträglich.","en":"The heat is unbearable.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759465","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"heat"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Es ist unerträglich heiß diesen Sommer.","en":"It is unbearably hot this summer.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"hot"},{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"summer"}]},{"text":"Die häusliche Situation wird jeden Tag unerträglicher.","en":"The situation at home is getting more unbearable every day.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"domestic","l":"häuslich"},{"g":"situation"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},{"g":"day"},null]}]}